       (deviation "K local (A = Z(K) a compact NV domain, uw a uniformizer, M(A) = (uw)); x /= 0 (the guard the notes leave implicit). Integer powers are NV-ZPOW(K, uw, k), the y with y uw^b = uw^a for a = max(k,0), b = max(-k,0). Existence: x = uw^k u with k in ZZ and u in NV-UNITS(K, A). Uniqueness: uw^k u = uw^l v implies k = l and u = v.")
       (notes-statement "Every a in K is w^k u for unique k in Z and u in U(Z(K))."))

