       (deviation "K local: A = Z(K) a compact NV domain, w in A, M(A) = (w), w /= 0. Three statements: w in M and 0 < |w| < 1; u w is a uniformizer for u a unit; two uniformizers w, w2 satisfy w2 = u w for a unit u. Proven 2026-11-09 (CCR-1109-C3).")
       (notes-statement "Any two uniformizing parameters differ by a unit."))

(entry (doc "ccr")
       (ref "4.5")
