       (notes-statement "phi positive on an involutive Banach algebra A with unit. There is a representation pi : A -> L(H) with cyclic vector xi, phi(x) = <pi(x) xi | xi>; if rho : A -> L(K) has cyclic eta with f_(rho, eta) = phi, there is a unitary W : H -> K with W xi = eta and W pi(x) = rho(x) W."))

